{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022010009437-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022064342\"/><p>遇襲男子負傷往醫院求診。</p><p>將軍澳發生傷人案。昨日(21日)晚上11時許，一名頭及手部受傷男子，負傷往將軍澳醫院求醫，他報稱在寶寧里遭人斬傷。警員接報抵院及往現場調查，事件來龍去脈有待追查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:00:54.555607+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:17:56.672545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:57:56.282906+00:00","content_hash":"1210813892c640597556b9ddbad0bd0d843316089c178bdedd3c22f67cf5a555","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}